WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:09.269
Facebook has 1.4 billion active users, that
means one-fifth of Earth's population has

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:10.940
a Facebook account.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.400
Let's find out some mind-blowing facts about
the social networking giant.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.489
1.

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:27.529
The average user spends 40 minutes a day on
Facebook.

00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:28.529
2.

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:34.310
Some people spend so much time on Facebook
that there is actually a medically recognised

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:42.309
condition called FAD, or Facebook Addiction
Disorder, that is someone whom is wholly reliant

00:00:42.309 --> 00:00:47.280
on Facebook and spends more than 3 hours on
it a day.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:54.230
There are estimated to be around 350 million
people in the world unknowingly suffering

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.920
from Facebook Addiction Disorder.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:03.100
A common symptom of FAD is adding complete
strangers as friends to artificially inflate

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.739
their friend count.

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:11.410
In fact research has shown that 80% of people
on the friends list of people who suffer from

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.820
FAD are fake friends.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.070
3.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:20.740
600,000 hacking attempts are made on Facebook
accounts every single day.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.740
4.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:28.210
Facebook will actually pay you if you successfully
hack their website and report the details

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.720
of your hack to Facebook.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:36.780
This helps Facebook uncover bugs and fix security
holes before other hackers with more malicious

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.090
intentions find it and abuse it.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:49.160
Facebook will pay you anywhere between $500
and $40,000 dollars if you can hack their

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.460
site.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.770
5.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:57.940
Al Pacino was the first ever face to appear
on Facebook, he appeared in the header of

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.850
the original website.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.040
Nobody is really sure why Zuckerberg chose
Al Pacino.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.040
6.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:13.250
On average, every Facebook user is separated
by only 3.74 degrees of separation, from every

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.239
other Facebook user.

00:02:15.239 --> 00:02:20.939
Or to put it another way, if you take any
other Facebook user in the world, they are

00:02:20.939 --> 00:02:26.030
friends with someone who is friends with another
person, who is friends with someone else who

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:29.660
has a friend that is also a friend of yours.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:30.680
7.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:34.379
You can't block Mark Zuckerberg on Facebook.

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:37.469
Attempting to do so will display an error
message.

00:02:37.469 --> 00:02:38.469
8.

00:02:38.469 --> 00:02:43.530
The Facebook like button was originally going
to be called the "awesome" button.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.530
9.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:52.159
In 2005, Myspace was engaged in talks to buy
Facebook, but they rejected Mark Zuckerberg's

00:02:52.159 --> 00:02:57.450
asking price of $75 million as too expensive.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:58.450
10.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:04.680
Facebook now brings in a colossal $3 billion
in revenue every quarter.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:05.680
11.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:10.959
Facebook has a whole 1 billion more users
than Twitter does.

00:03:10.959 --> 00:03:11.959
12.

00:03:11.959 --> 00:03:18.670
Amongst Facebook's huge feature set used to
be a peer-to-peer file-sharing service called

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.970
Wirehog.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:25.819
When Facebook launched in 2004 users could
upload files to their account then share them

00:03:25.819 --> 00:03:27.859
with their Facebook friends.

00:03:27.859 --> 00:03:33.909
However Wirehog was eventually axed in 2006
due to security concerns.

00:03:33.909 --> 00:03:34.909
13.

00:03:34.909 --> 00:03:42.000
Similar to Google, Facebook employees get
three completely free meals a day as well

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.639
as free drinks.

00:03:43.639 --> 00:03:48.099
Cooked by the self entitled "Facebook Culinary
Team".

00:03:48.099 --> 00:03:53.689
There's actually a Facebook app to see what's
on the menu at the Facebook headquarters each

00:03:53.689 --> 00:03:59.469
day, so Facebook employees don't even need
to leave their seats to order lunch.

00:03:59.469 --> 00:04:01.980
It's called the "Lunchtime" app.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:02.980
14.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.969
Don't worry Facebook employees, if you get
fired from Facebook you can always sell your

00:04:07.969 --> 00:04:08.969
hoodie.

00:04:08.969 --> 00:04:17.500
A standard issue Facebook employee hoodie
sold on eBay for a whopping $4,050 with 50

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.200
bidders battling it out.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.200
15.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:23.680
But Facebook also has a few dark secrets.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:31.500
Facebook tracks every site you visit, by using
JavaScript, iframes and cookies.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.379
It can even track you when you're logged out.

00:04:35.379 --> 00:04:41.610
This is how Facebook shows you ridiculously
accurate adverts, and knows stuff about you

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.500
that seem unbelievably invasive.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.670
Such as when you're pregnant, or where you're
planning to go on holiday.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:49.670
16.

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:56.310
There have also been allegations that Facebook
automatically scans your private messages

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:02.580
to build up an overall picture of what you're
interested in, so they can show you more accurate

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.220
advertisements.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:10.099
Although Facebook has denied this behaviour,
the astonishing accuracy of their adverts

00:05:10.099 --> 00:05:12.300
seems to suggest otherwise.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.300
17.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:19.520
Even more shocking, there have been cases
of people being murdered because they unfriended

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.190
someone on Facebook.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:29.449
One such case was in 2012 when a couple unfriended
a woman on Facebook, the unfriended woman's

00:05:29.449 --> 00:05:36.030
father was so angered by this, that he went
to the couple's house and shot them both.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:42.210
There was also the shocking case of a woman
who set fire to her friend's house after being

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.159
unfriended on Facebook.

00:05:44.159 --> 00:05:45.159
18.

00:05:45.159 --> 00:05:49.070
Facebook is also responsible for an enormous
amount of divorces.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:56.190
A frightening study showed that Facebook was
a major contributing factor in up to one-third

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.530
of all divorces.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.530
19.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:03.069
But all this Facebook use may not be as good
for you as you think.

00:06:03.069 --> 00:06:10.020
A study suggested that 1 in 3 people feel
more dissatisfied with their lives after visiting

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.020
Facebook.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.020
20.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:19.409
Also a survey showed that 25% of Facebook
users have been dumped on Facebook at one

00:06:19.409 --> 00:06:26.740
point and, what's even more worrying, it's
becoming increasingly common for people to

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:32.650
end relationships by simply changing their
Facebook status from "In a relationship."

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:33.650
to "Single".

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:34.650
21.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:40.620
And finally, there is strong evidence to suggest
that Facebook is dumbing down society.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:46.909
A study conducted at the Ohio State University
showed that the average grades of students

00:06:46.909 --> 00:06:57.180
who use Facebook were a whole grade lower
than students who don't use Facebook.

